abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a bivariate conditional-likelihood rectangular-sieve
  estimator for samples included when at least one coordinate exceeds its
  object-specific threshold, with one-sided censoring of a nondetected coordinate.
keywords:
  - conditional likelihood
  - truncation
  - one-sided censoring
  - bivariate distribution
  - sieve estimation
  - survival analysis
